kstar explain
*************

Usage: kstar explain <code>
       kstar explain --list

Explains an error or warning code, such as E0200 or W0100, with an example.
Every error message shows its code in brackets: NameError[E0200].

Options:
  --list              list every code with its title

Examples:
  kstar explain E0200
      explain one code
  kstar explain --list
      list them all


